Package: VAPOR
Type: Package
Title: Vector Autoregressive Precision factOR Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Dunson", email = "peteradunsonn@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Joint Bayesian estimation of vector autoregression dynamics and a sparse innovation precision matrix. The VAR coefficients receive a Dirichlet-Laplace prior and the innovation precision matrix is modeled as a low-rank plus diagonal factor decomposition with a Dirichlet-Laplace prior on the loadings and a Dirichlet process prior on the idiosyncratic variances. A single Gibbs sampler updates both jointly.
